   Added a real-`TaskManager` reduced-pipeline regression test that asserts
   terminal stage statuses for view (`graph_view=completed`, `optimize=skipped`,
   `adjacency=completed`) and table (`optimize=completed`) modes; preserved
   existing call-contract coverage and fixed top-level blank-line spacing.
