attempt CloudFetch downloads through the Kernel transport, producing repeated
network failures. Build DDL and writes now always use Thrift, while the separate
Lakehouse//RT query warehouse retains its required SEA/Kernel path. Expected
403 responses from the app-permission REST probe also fall back quietly.

